Implementation: get {year, month, day, hour} in TZ. todayStr = `${y}-${m}-${d}`. If hour < 10 → {today, LUNCH}; else if hour < 15 → {today, DINNER}; else {tomorrow, LUNCH}. isSlotOpen: if date < today → false; if date > today → true; same day: LUNCH open if hour<10, DINNER open if hour<15.

addDays: parse and use UTC date math.

Tests: construct Dates with known Shanghai time. Use UTC times: e.g. 2026-09-22T01:00:00Z = 09:00 Shanghai → today LUNCH. 2026-09-22T03:00Z = 11:00 → DINNER. 2026-09-22T08:00Z = 16:00 → tomorrow LUNCH.

