export function register(...) similarly
export function logout() { return apiRequest<void>('/auth/logout', {method:'POST'}); }
```

AuthContext: useQuery(['me'], fetchMe with 401 → null). Better approach: queryFn that catches ApiError 401 and returns null; retry false.

```tsx
