```tsx
export function RequireAuth({ children }: { children: JSX.Element }) 
export function RequireAdmin({ children })
```
Use ReactNode instead of JSX.Element to avoid namespace issues (React 18 types: JSX.Element fine). I'll use ReactElement.

LoginPage: AntD Form, on finish → mutation login → setUser → navigate(from || '/menu', replace). Error: if ApiError 401 → copy.auth.loginFailed else describeError. Show via antd App message + Alert.

RegisterPage: similar with password validation rule (regex: at least 8, letters+numbers). After register → setUser → navigate /menu.

AuthLayout: centered card, logo title.

